==Strategy==
This is almost identical to [[Hyaluronan Mountain]], but with most enemies at a higher strength magnification. The same strategies of heavy meatshielding and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] hardcarrying you apply here as much as it did for that stage.

